      "name": "Mobile-only order fulfilled",
      "description": "An order with two monthly mobile plans and a one-time SIM fee is activated item by item, monthly payments are set up and the customer is notified. The one-time fee keeps the order valid: the blueprint's price calculation fails on orders with no one-time item.",
